ctice with care, expertise, and a deep respect for the tradition&#8217;s transformative power.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-a6093af elementor-invisible elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"a6093af\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;_animation&quot;:&quot;fadeInRight&quot;}\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">What Makes Kundalini Yoga Different<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-d1daacd elementor-invisible elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"d1daacd\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;_animation&quot;:&quot;fadeInRight&quot;}\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Unlike other yoga styles that focus primarily on physical postures, Kundalini Yoga works directly with your nervous system, glandular system, and energy body. Sessions include kriyas (specific exercise sets), pranayama (breathwork), meditation, and often mantra \u2014 making it one of the most comprehensive and rapidly transformative practices available.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6112d86 elementor-invisible elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"6112d86\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;_animation&quot;:&quot;fadeInRight&quot;}\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Who Benefits Most from Kundalini Yoga in South Delhi<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-af5852d elementor-invisible elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"af5852d\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;_animation&quot;:&quot;fadeInRight&qu